Subject: [PATCH] Pagination for Order history, Customers and the Money book
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- One pager for admin lists: "11–20 of 134", numbered pages with … for gaps, previous/next
- Order history: 10 per page by default; Customers: 25; both can show 10 / 25 / 50, and the
  choice is kept when filtering
- Money book: day-by-day table and "sales not billed" list page 10 at a time, separately

